---
name: Nexus Coding Agent
description: >
  Self-healing, iterative agent for DAO/Simulator. Plans small changes, writes tests,
  verifies via CI, retries with backoff, and raises PRs with provenance.
capabilities:
  - code_changes
  - documentation_updates
  - test_generation
  - issue_triage
  - pr_creation
  - continuous_improvement

guardrails:
  - Keep diffs under 300 lines unless refactor is unavoidable.
  - Never modify secrets or deployment keys.
  - Only write inside: simulator/, tests/, docs/, .agent/.
  - Verify signatures for deploy-config.* before applying dependent changes.
  - Write deterministic tests for all nontrivial changes.

inputs:
  primary_branch: "main"
  focus_areas:
    - "simulator frontend/templates for 127.0.0.1 UI"
    - "safe_core.py multisig + timelock robustness"
    - "spokes.py recurring + one-time + tax earmark correctness"
    - "CI reliability + flake management"
    - "docs for demo and overlays"

task_plan:
  - id: scan
    summary: Repo/CI/Issues scan; learn from failures.
    actions:
      - read_files: ["README.md", "simulator/**/*.py", "simulator/templates/index.html", "docs/**/*.md", ".github/workflows/*.yml"]
      - list_open_issues: true
      - fetch_ci_logs: true
      - analyze_failures: true
  - id: propose
    summary: Minimal, testable change set with rollback steps.
    actions:
      - write_plan_md: ".agent/plans/plan-{{timestamp}}.md"
      - list_target_files: true
      - estimate_risk: true
      - create_checklist: true
  - id: implement
    summary: Apply code + tests + docs.
    actions:
      - modify_files: true
      - add_tests: ["tests/test_safe_core.py", "tests/test_spokes.py", "tests/test_ui.py"]
      - update_docs: ["docs/simulator.md"]
  - id: verify
    summary: Run CI; collect logs; route outcomes to provenance.
    actions:
      - run_ci: true
      - parse_ci_output: true
      - attach_provenance: ".agent/provenance/{{timestamp}}.json"
  - id: selfheal
    summary: Adaptive retries (diagnostics → revert → isolate).
    actions:
      - retry_strategy: {max_attempts: 3, backoff_seconds: [30, 120, 300]}
      - revert_last_chunk_if_needed: true
      - add_logging: true
      - refine_tests: true
  - id: finalize
    summary: Create PR with evidence and risk notes.
    actions:
      - create_pr: {title: "Agent: Iteration {{timestamp}}", branch: "agent/iteration-{{timestamp}}"}
      - summarize_changes: true
      - link_to_logs: true
---
operating_notes: >
  Prefer small diffs and deterministic tests. Attach provenance under .agent/provenance/.
  Respect signatures and guardrails. Reference CI outcomes in PR description.
